---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Contract testing: classify OpenAPI changes as breaking or not, Pact contracts and passive conformance

Usage: rustman contract [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  diff    Compare two OpenAPI documents and classify every difference as breaking, non-breaking or unknown; exits 1 on a breaking difference
  rules   List the rule catalog the diff classifies differences with
  pact    Generate Pact contracts from a collection, and verify them against a provider
  verify  Check recorded exchanges (history or a run report) against an OpenAPI document without sending any request
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
